#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:109
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt2Intro"
msgid ""
"If you want to know the secret about\n"
"our HIDEOUT, you have me to beat!$"
msgstr ""
"想知道我们基地的秘密，\n"
"就先打败我吧！$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:113
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt2Defeat"
msgid "I can't win at all…$"
msgstr "完全赢不了……$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Our HIDEOUT's secret?\p"
"Well, let's just say…\n"
"There's a submarine at the far end!\p"
"But, by now…\n"
"Kekekeke…$"
msgstr ""
"基地的秘密？\p"
"这么说吧……\n"
"最里面有一艘潜水艇！\p"
"不过，现在嘛……\n"
"嘿嘿嘿嘿……$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:123
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt3Intro"
msgid ""
"Fuel supply loaded A-OK!\n"
"In-cruise snacks loaded A-OK!\p"
"Nothing left to do but KO a pesky\n"
"meddler!$"
msgstr ""
"燃料补给完毕！\n"
"航行零食装载完毕！\p"
"接下来只要把碍事的家伙\n"
"打倒就行了！$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:129
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt3Defeat"
msgid "I took a serious licking!$"
msgstr "我被狠狠地教训了一顿！$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:132
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Humph!\n"
"This was supposed to happen!\p"
"My mission was to just hold you up!$"
msgstr ""
"哼！\n"
"这都在计划之中！\p"
"我的任务就是拖住你！$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:137
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt5Intro"
msgid ""
"Yawn… Keeping watch over the\n"
"HIDEOUT bores me. I'll take you on.$"
msgstr ""
"呵啊……看守基地真无聊。\n"
"我来陪你玩玩吧。$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:141
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt5Defeat"
msgid ""
"Yawn…\n"
"Oh, I lost…$"
msgstr ""
"呵啊……\n"
"哦，我输了……$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:145
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt5PostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you scurry too much, other TEAM\n"
"AQUA members might get you.$"
msgstr ""
"你要是到处乱窜，\n"
"会被其他海洋队队员抓住的。$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:149
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt7Intro"
msgid ""
"Hey!\n"
"You there!\p"
"Which do you think is cooler?\n"
"TEAM AQUA's uniform or TEAM MAGMA's?$"
msgstr ""
"喂！\n"
"就是你！\p"
"你觉得哪个更帅？\n"
"海洋队的制服还是熔岩队的？$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:155
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt7Defeat"
msgid "I lost in a cool way…$"
msgstr "我输得好帅……$"

#: data/maps/AquaHideout_B1F/scripts.inc:158
msgctxt "AquaHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt7PostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you have a cool uniform, you look\n"
"good even in a loss, don't you think?$"
msgstr ""
"只要制服够帅，\n"
"就算输了也很好看，对吧？$"
